From: Sky UK
Date: Fri, 31 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add /opt/appmapping.json to extraMounts in dobby.generic.json

Bind-mount /opt/appmapping.json read-write into every Dobby-managed
container via meta-rdk dobby.generic.json so that the appId-to-
appInstanceId mapping file maintained by AppsStatus is visible to
processes running inside containers.

Source: Sky UK
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Sky UK specific]

Signed-off-by: Sky UK
---
 meta-rdk/recipes-containers/dobby/files/dobby.generic.json | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/meta-rdk/recipes-containers/dobby/files/dobby.generic.json b/meta-rdk/recipes-containers/dobby/files/dobby.generic.json
index 4a25c83a..XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX 100644
--- a/meta-rdk/recipes-containers/dobby/files/dobby.generic.json
+++ b/meta-rdk/recipes-containers/dobby/files/dobby.generic.json
@@ -11,6 +11,15 @@
     "network": {
       "externalInterfaces": [ "eth0", "wlan0" ],
       "addressRange": "100.64.11.0"
     },
+    "extraMounts": [
+      {
+        "source": "/opt/appmapping.json",
+        "destination": "/opt/appmapping.json",
+        "type": "bind",
+        "options": [ "rbind", "rw" ]
+      }
+    ],
     "logRelay": {
         "syslog": {
           "enable": true,
-- 
2.39.0
